          "content": "ES REVIEWED: ICT \u2013 HH not eligible as no break in benefits. Sample SAR 7 reviewed: customer informed by prior CO of how to complete and submit the report. Supplemental forms sent: DPSS 4022, DPSS 2263, Temp 2201, RVSD 512b, EBT 2216, SAR 7A, PUB 13, PUB 275, PUB 388, ADM 109, VRC, CW 2223."
        }
      ]
